"```\n"
"Runtime → Serveur :  {\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"3\",\"method\":\"tools/"
"call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"search\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"rapport "
"Q1\"}}}\n"
"Runtime ← Serveur :  {\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"3\",\"result\":"
"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"...\"}]}}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
