#: src/components/desktop.md:1
msgid "Application Desktop — Tauri v2 + Runtime embarque"
msgstr "Application Desktop — Tauri v2 + Runtime embarque"

#: src/components/desktop.md:3
msgid ""
"_L'application desktop Apollia OS embarque le runtime complet dans un "
"processus unique. Double-clic → fenetre → 10 vues temps reel couvrant 100% "
"des capacites CLI._"
msgstr ""
"_L'application desktop Apollia OS embarque le runtime complet dans un "
"processus unique. Double-clic → fenetre → 10 vues temps reel couvrant 100% "
"des capacites CLI._"

#: src/components/desktop.md:7
msgid "1. Architecture — Processus unique (ADR-027)"
msgstr "1. Architecture — Processus unique (ADR-027)"

#: src/components/desktop.md:9
msgid ""
"L'application desktop est une crate Tauri v2 (`apollia-desktop`) qui demarre "
"le runtime Apollia en interne via `init_embedded()`. Un seul binaire "
"distribue a la fois le runtime Rust et le frontend Svelte."
msgstr ""
"L'application desktop est une crate Tauri v2 (`apollia-desktop`) qui demarre "
"le runtime Apollia en interne via `init_embedded()`. Un seul binaire "
"distribue a la fois le runtime Rust et le frontend Svelte."

#: src/components/desktop.md:11
msgid ""
"```\n"
"main() Tauri\n"
"  │\n"
"  ├── init_embedded(config) → RuntimeHandle\n"
"  │     └── thread \"apollia-runtime\"\n"
"  │           └── Supervisor.start() → AllReady\n"
"  │\n"
"  ├── setup_tray() → SystemTray (icone + menu contextuel)\n"
"  │\n"
"  └── tauri::Builder\n"
"        ├── .manage(RuntimeHandle)     ← etat partage\n"
"        ├── .invoke_handler(commands)  ← 29 commandes IPC\n"
"        ├── .plugin(dialog)            ← file picker natif\n"
"        ├── .plugin(notification)      ← notifications natives\n"
"        └── .run()                     ← ouvre la WebView\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"main() Tauri\n"
"  │\n"
"  ├── init_embedded(config) → RuntimeHandle\n"
"  │     └── thread \"apollia-runtime\"\n"
"  │           └── Supervisor.start() → AllReady\n"
"  │\n"
"  ├── setup_tray() → SystemTray (icone + menu contextuel)\n"
"  │\n"
"  └── tauri::Builder\n"
"        ├── .manage(RuntimeHandle)     ← etat partage\n"
"        ├── .invoke_handler(commands)  ← 29 commandes IPC\n"
"        ├── .plugin(dialog)            ← file picker natif\n"
"        ├── .plugin(notification)      ← notifications natives\n"
"        └── .run()                     ← ouvre la WebView\n"
"```"

